# .clineignore — keep the agent focused on source code, not data or generated artifacts.
#
# Notes:
# - Cline labels .clineignore as "deprecate soon". The same intent is mirrored in
#   .clinerules/06-git-artifacts-and-docs.md and in .gitignore, so keep all three in sync.
# - No negation (!) patterns on purpose: support varies between Cline versions.
# - Nothing under fmperf/, requests/, examples/ or docs/ that is *source* may be ignored here.

# ── Python caches and build outputs ───────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.eggs/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# ── Virtual environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/

# ── Experiment outputs (data, not source) ─────────────────────────────────────
# results tree, generated per-iteration CSVs and raw payloads
results/
results*/
**/results/
**/output.csv
**/first_half.csv
**/second_half.csv
**/prompts.csv
**/results.json
**/results_all.json
examples/*.csv
examples/*.json

# Slurm / run logs
logs/
pod_logs*/
*.out
slurm-*.err
test_logs.log

# ── Large datasets and binary fixtures ────────────────────────────────────────
oasst_roots_en_max1000_tokens.jsonl
**/*.jsonl
*.pkl
fmperf/data/all_nbins_64.pkl
fmperf/loadgen/tests/**/*.csv

# ── Legacy / dead code ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Stale copy of fmperf/loadgen/run.py: nothing imports it and it must not be edited.
/loadgen

# ── Sibling project (see .gitignore) ──────────────────────────────────────────
MoST-dashboard-api/

# ── Local runtime config ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .env is intentionally NOT ignored: it holds no secrets, only experiment knobs
# (URL, TOKENS_LIST, REQ_MIN_START, EXPERIMENT_TYPE, DURATION) that are usually
# required to explain a run's behaviour. Uncomment to hide it.
# .env
